ScoreOrbit data: licence notice

This repository holds two kinds of content under two licences.

1. Data: results.json, upcoming.json and variants.json

   Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
   (CC BY-SA 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

   Much of the data is taken from Wikipedia, whose text is available under the
   same licence (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Copyrights). It is
   credited to the Wikipedia contributors; the page history of each article
   lists the individual authors, and every event's "sources" list names the
   pages it was read from. The data was reduced to facts (who played whom, the
   round, the score) and reorganised, so it has been changed from the source.
   Other cited sites are linked as references only; their text is not copied.

   If you reuse the data you must credit Wikipedia contributors with a link to
   the licence above, say that you changed it, and share your version under
   CC BY-SA 4.0 as well.

